WEBVTT

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:06.335
Once we're through here, we should
be in the outskirts of Gartlant.

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:09.467
I bet we'll just hit another dead end
'cause of all the stupid land shifts.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.533
Then we'll just make a new path!

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:13.545
Nothing ever pleases you,
does it, Your Hana-ness!

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.412
"Your Hana--"?!
Don't call me funny names!

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:19.009
| was born with the proud
name of Mitsurugi Hanagata!

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.986
No lousy marionette's going
to call me "Your Hana-ness""

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:24.756
Just keep moving, Hanagata!

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.350
Yeah, Hannie!
Or we'll leave you behind!

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:28.895
Stop calling me goo-goo names!!

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:30.930
Master Otaru! That's the way out!

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.981
That's Gartlant?

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.936
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:19.506
| was born to be with you.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:22.883
The moment I awoke...

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:26.986
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.656
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:34.225
I was born to hold you.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:37.397
Lies and truths...

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:41.523
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:46.270
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.129
...won't get to me.

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:51.636
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:55.204
...can be ours once again!

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:59.815
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:03.618
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:07.058
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:11.826
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:24.936
Having overthrown Peterburg,
Faust decided...

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:27.571
...to make Japoness
his next target.

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:30.275
On a mission to take out the
Gartlant Army's tactical computer...

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.752
...Otaru was compelled to head
out to Gartlant with Lime...

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.779
...Cherry, and Bloodberry in tow,
to thwart Faust's evil plans!

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:42.488
Our heroes were momentarily jeopardized
by an encounter with Tiger and Panta...

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:45.532
...but the attackers
were repelled by mice.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:49.626
And now, Otaru and company are
about to set foot inside Gartlant!

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:59.070
Infiltration Of
The Dark Empire

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:11.385
You failed to strike down that
Japoness monkey and his sabers?!

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:14.326
Can I not trust you to
mind matters while I'm gone?!

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:19.960
Luchs, from now on,
you are in command.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.695
Deploy our troops
to Japoness immediately!

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:24.237
Sir!

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:27.498
But, Lord Faust!

00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:29.201
Please give me another chance!

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:31.134
SILENCE!

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:36.706
You... Those who possess
the maiden circuits...

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:39.582
...cannot live without
the love of a man!

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:44.715
The moment I discard you will be
the moment you die! Understood?!

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:46.726
Yes, m'Lord!

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:50.962
| will eliminate all of
the fools who oppose me...

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:53.692
...and mighty Gartlant
will be victorious!

00:04:20.026 --> 00:04:21.585
This is horrid!

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:24.096
This place sure could use some color.

00:04:25.164 --> 00:04:28.099
Hey, Otaru! Lookit, lookit!
There are funny signs everywhere!

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.139
Wh-What the hell?

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:42.182
Hey, tell me!
Do those blow up, too?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.519
Man, that eats me!
Talk about bad taste!

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:54.117
I don't care HOW powerful
Faust is, he's gone too far!

00:04:54.193 --> 00:04:56.127
Now, now. Don't get so excited!

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:58.991
Listen to her, Master Otaru!

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:03.001
Let's all calm down and
hold a council meeting.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:09.236
Gartlant is a military-industry town
run by an 8VC central computer.

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:14.110
The SVC that manages all of the
city's functions is contained in here!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.978
But... There's nothing there at all!

00:05:16.282 --> 00:05:19.809
Normally, something that important
would be safely hidden underground.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.612
Those stinking cowards!
They're not men!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:27.751
At any rate, if we destroy that,
the war will come to a halt, right?

00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:31.593
Yes. But, to get to
this point below ground...

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:35.396
...we will have to break through
their military installation.

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:37.562
And that's where we come in, right?

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:38.900
Right, right!

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:42.566
Exactly! And while you do that,
Master Otaru and I...

00:05:42.642 --> 00:05:46.545
...will take the underground tunnels
and set time bombs on the computer.

00:05:46.612 --> 00:05:47.545
What??

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:51.174
After that, he and I will exit
unscathed and return to Japoness...

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:55.244
...50, the rest of you can go
your separate ways accordingly!

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:58.951
Stop right there!! Are you saying
the rest of us are just decoys??!

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:01.050
Exactly!

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:03.459
NAY!" I rule to dismiss this plan!

00:06:03.529 --> 00:06:05.554
I second that motion!
The ones to sneak underground...

00:06:05.631 --> 00:06:09.033
...should be Otaru, accompanied by the
drop-dead gorgeous Mitsurugi Hanagata!

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:13.534
I'm not going to let
you be alone with him!

00:06:13.606 --> 00:06:15.438
I'll be the one
who goes with Otaru!

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:19.073
But, can you access the main computer
that locks the defensive wall...

00:06:19.145 --> 00:06:21.705
...to the underground pathway
with your circuits?

00:06:22.648 --> 00:06:24.116
That's dirty!

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:26.845
Then, I guess it's settled.

00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:29.547
Bloodberry... I'll
be depending on you!

00:06:31.724 --> 00:06:33.556
Since you insist, I'll do it.

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:38.593
Master Otaru! I'll do my
very best not to be a burden!!

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:40.723
Hey! C'mon, Cherry...
Knock it of f!

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:43.060
Otaru.

00:06:46.873 --> 00:06:48.432
L-Lime?

00:06:49.142 --> 00:06:51.270
Otary, I... I'm...

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:53.838
Lime?! No way...

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.877
I'm hungry.

00:07:09.862 --> 00:07:15.323
Honestly! Can't you even be serious
in this kind of a situation?!

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:17.062
But I'm hungry...

00:07:18.137 --> 00:07:20.629
Well, you can't fight a war
on an empty stomach!

00:07:20.706 --> 00:07:23.073
For now, let's find
somewhere to fill up!

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:25.804
This is what happens when
you go on a long journey...

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:29.542
...without bringing provisions!
His Hana-ness is so unthoughtful!

00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:34.281
You're the ones who
devoured it all"!

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:38.682
| was out of line!

00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:41.827
Oh?
What is that?

00:07:55.575 --> 00:07:58.510
Wow... People DO live here.

00:07:58.578 --> 00:08:00.512
What's that truck for?

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:05.484
I heard that Gartlant controls
quality of life by computer as well.

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:07.747
That is probably a rations truck.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.312
WHAT?! FOOD?
Food, food, food!

00:08:10.957 --> 00:08:13.551
Wow. That's dif ferent!

00:08:13.626 --> 00:08:17.187
Oh, well! Since we're here,
let's grab us some grub!

00:08:25.004 --> 00:08:26.972
Input identity code.

00:08:27.907 --> 00:08:30.774
Identity code? Let's see...

00:08:32.712 --> 00:08:34.180
How about THIS?

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:50.154
Identity code confirmed.
Commencing rations.

00:08:51.097 --> 00:08:52.724
All right!

00:08:56.869 --> 00:08:58.132
That's IT?

00:08:58.204 --> 00:09:00.172
What a crappy deal.

00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:03.070
Hey! You can do
better than that!

00:09:03.142 --> 00:09:05.110
Give us something we
can sink our teeth into!

00:09:05.578 --> 00:09:09.208
Be on your way, citizen.
Complaint is an act of rebellion.

00:09:10.216 --> 00:09:13.481
It seems that the amount
of rations is fixed...

00:09:13.553 --> 00:09:15.851
...regardless of age or numbers.

00:09:35.141 --> 00:09:37.906
Its vocal sensor is directly
linked to their patrol forces.

00:09:37.977 --> 00:09:40.969
"Complaint is an act of rebellion,”
might not be altogether untrue.

00:09:41.614 --> 00:09:45.244
You crappy machine! You can't give
lousy service and then call us rebels!

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:47.616
We Japoness men
aren't that patient!

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:49.619
Get it, Lime!

00:09:49.689 --> 00:09:52.386
Right! GOT IT!

00:09:52.558 --> 00:09:53.992
Oh, no! Lime, don't"

00:10:08.541 --> 00:10:09.770
Go ahead!

00:10:09.842 --> 00:10:12.573
What you just had
couldn't have been enough.

00:10:12.645 --> 00:10:15.137
There's nothing to
worry about, take 'em!

00:10:15.214 --> 00:10:16.841
C..Canl|?

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.845
Thank you!

00:10:29.829 --> 00:10:31.297
You!

00:10:39.005 --> 00:10:40.473
You okay, kid?!

00:10:42.074 --> 00:10:45.066
I'm so sorry... I didn't mean for
them to think YOU had taken the food...

00:10:45.144 --> 00:10:47.704
This country is in worse
shape than they say it is.

00:10:55.287 --> 00:10:57.688
Master Otaru, we have
to leave this area NOW!

00:10:57.923 --> 00:11:00.324
I know!
Those annoying bastards...

00:11:01.727 --> 00:11:03.195
Just you wait, kid.

00:11:03.262 --> 00:11:06.197
Soon, I'll make it so you'll get
enough to eat every single day!

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:11.326
We have to destroy that computer
whosis, and the sooner, the better!

00:11:11.771 --> 00:11:15.230
Lime, Bloodberry! And, Hanagata.
Take care things upstairs, okay?

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:18.572
Guess I'll have to.
All right, you can count on me!!

00:11:18.644 --> 00:11:21.341
You can count on me!

00:11:22.648 --> 00:11:24.980
Otaru, |-I gotta stay, too?!

00:11:25.217 --> 00:11:27.686
- Let's go, Cherry!
- Coming, Master Otaru!

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:30.084
Good luck

00:12:06.292 --> 00:12:07.760
What do you think?

00:12:07.827 --> 00:12:09.591
That is the trial model?

00:12:09.662 --> 00:12:13.621
Yes, the land-roving carrier ship
powered by converted plasma energy...

00:12:13.699 --> 00:12:16.669
<i>.the TF-01"Krabbensteif "</i>

00:12:17.269 --> 00:12:20.534
The question at hand is its
size and cost performance.

00:12:25.644 --> 00:12:30.582
If it proves feasible, the taming
of Terra Il would become child's play.

00:12:30.783 --> 00:12:31.272
What's more...

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.079
Hess, step up its completion!

00:12:33.152 --> 00:12:34.620
Sir!

00:12:40.626 --> 00:12:41.593
What?!

00:13:03.415 --> 00:13:04.883
That's one!

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:13.183
He's so funny!

00:13:17.263 --> 00:13:19.231
They're cuter this way!

00:13:26.338 --> 00:13:27.897
What are you doing?!

00:13:33.078 --> 00:13:34.546
Yoop!

00:13:41.654 --> 00:13:43.679
Hel... Hel... Hel...!!

00:13:48.761 --> 00:13:51.162
I'm not licked yet...!!

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:13.618
Lime... Bloodberry...!

00:15:10.676 --> 00:15:14.909
WHY, YOU...! You dare
ridicule me, you insect?!

00:15:15.281 --> 00:15:19.479
This is unforgivable! Destroy every
last one of them, IMMEDIATELY!!

00:15:19.551 --> 00:15:21.019
Sir!

00:15:22.588 --> 00:15:24.989
Damn those Japoness sabers!

00:15:25.624 --> 00:15:28.855
Still, this is the perfect opportunity
to regain Lord Faust's trust.

00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:30.453
Don't screw up!

00:15:30.529 --> 00:15:31.997
Damned right I won't!

00:15:35.167 --> 00:15:40.162
Strange... The monitor only showed
two sabers and one blip.

00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:42.241
Why...?

00:15:54.553 --> 00:15:56.214
Here comes!

00:15:56.355 --> 00:15:58.483
Here goes!

00:16:04.596 --> 00:16:05.722
Gimme five!

00:16:06.198 --> 00:16:07.597
That's far enough.

00:16:07.666 --> 00:16:09.259
Oh, it's you again.

00:16:09.335 --> 00:16:10.803
You will atone for your
mockery of Lord Faust...

00:16:10.869 --> 00:16:12.598
...with your lives!

00:16:12.671 --> 00:16:14.400
Just you try it!

00:16:14.473 --> 00:16:15.565
Hey!

00:16:15.641 --> 00:16:17.837
We have to wait until
Otaru gets back, remember?

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.571
We can't take them on now!

00:16:19.645 --> 00:16:20.703
Oh, yeah.

00:16:20.779 --> 00:16:22.304
Stop your whispering!

00:16:27.353 --> 00:16:30.482
Why does this always happen to me?!!!
Somebody, help me!

00:16:30.622 --> 00:16:33.489
OHM A lone man
is beckoning to me!!

00:16:34.927 --> 00:16:36.452
And now, he's grabbed me!

00:16:37.529 --> 00:16:38.621
Where'd he go?!

00:16:38.697 --> 00:16:40.222
This way"

00:16:43.635 --> 00:16:45.103
I'm saved!

00:16:45.404 --> 00:16:47.930
I don't know who you are,
but bless your hearts!

00:16:48.007 --> 00:16:49.600
You poor thing...

00:16:49.675 --> 00:16:52.542
Those patrol guards
have no consideration.

00:16:52.611 --> 00:16:53.874
But, you're safe now.

00:16:53.946 --> 00:16:57.109
Oh, if I put my mind to it, it would be
child's play to take out those guys...

00:16:57.182 --> 00:16:59.241
...but I have swallowed my
pride for a dear friend...

00:16:59.318 --> 00:17:01.184
...allowing myself to be
chased around in circles.

00:17:01.253 --> 00:17:04.120
This is all a labor
of love! Of LOVE!

00:17:04.656 --> 00:17:08.115
Huh? Uh... Is this love?

00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:10.560
WE can capture greenhorns
like you, EASY.

00:17:10.629 --> 00:17:13.655
So, why let the patrol
get all the credit?

00:17:15.267 --> 00:17:16.632
Does this mean...?

00:17:17.703 --> 00:17:20.468
Don't worry.
It won't hurt a bit.

00:17:20.706 --> 00:17:23.004
C-Cruel! It's too cruell!!

00:17:23.075 --> 00:17:27.171
I, Mitsurugi Hanagata, must lay down
my life in a strange land for love???

00:17:27.646 --> 00:17:29.205
No, I don't wanna die!!!

00:17:30.616 --> 00:17:31.777
Come back here!!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.545
Like we expect you
to actually come back...

00:17:33.619 --> 00:17:36.088
Why does this happen to me?"

00:18:00.145 --> 00:18:02.614
This is Gartlant's main computer!

00:18:04.683 --> 00:18:06.310
This is it.

00:18:07.653 --> 00:18:10.554
If we destroy this,
the war will stop!

00:18:10.622 --> 00:18:12.021
Not only that...

00:18:14.159 --> 00:18:15.786
- Cherry!
- Understood!

00:18:37.082 --> 00:18:38.982
Why don't you fight back?!

00:18:41.553 --> 00:18:43.214
Hold it right there, you!

00:18:43.856 --> 00:18:46.188
Over here! Over here!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.394
Come and get me!

00:18:53.298 --> 00:18:55.596
You cowardly little scamp!

00:18:55.667 --> 00:18:57.192
Are we going to fight,
or aren't we?!!

00:18:57.269 --> 00:18:59.203
Maybe later!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.731
You little...!

00:19:08.714 --> 00:19:10.341
I'm sick of this... OPEN FIRE!

00:19:10.983 --> 00:19:12.451
Hey!

00:19:18.657 --> 00:19:20.352
Okay, so where are we?

00:19:24.296 --> 00:19:26.594
Oh, as I live and breathe,
if it isn't Otaru

00:19:26.698 --> 00:19:28.166
HANAGATA?!

00:19:28.233 --> 00:19:30.759
OTARU! How I've missed you!"
C'mon, give us a kiss!

00:19:36.742 --> 00:19:39.871
This is my second flight today!

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:46.650
That's Otaru Mamiya!
The one we've got a warrant for!

00:19:47.653 --> 00:19:49.280
Fire! Open fire!

00:19:55.661 --> 00:19:58.392
You won't lay a finger
on Master Otaru!

00:19:58.564 --> 00:19:59.793
Hey! Otaru's back!

00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:01.333
What?! He is?!!

00:20:04.269 --> 00:20:08.206
Take this! Cherry's deadly
rice tub boomerang"

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:20.546
| did it, Master Otaru!

00:20:20.619 --> 00:20:21.586
Oh?

00:20:21.653 --> 00:20:24.918
- Welcome back, Otaru!
- Otaru, I was so worried!

00:20:25.757 --> 00:20:27.589
| guess you're all okay, then!

00:20:27.659 --> 00:20:29.593
Yes, we're invincible.

00:20:30.162 --> 00:20:32.187
- How'd it go?
- Perfectly, thank you!

00:20:33.665 --> 00:20:35.224
Finally, you're all here!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:37.928
This time, we'll ship you all
to hell in a handbasket!

00:20:38.837 --> 00:20:42.364
Sorry, but our work is done,
and we're outta here!

00:20:42.441 --> 00:20:43.909
C'mon, guys!

00:20:46.745 --> 00:20:48.144
Let's make tracks!

00:20:48.213 --> 00:20:50.682
- What...?!
- Hey, come back here!

00:20:51.583 --> 00:20:53.574
You'll have to catch us first'!

00:20:56.355 --> 00:20:59.916
Dang! There's another one!
Don't stop, just bulldoze 'er

00:21:05.631 --> 00:21:07.030
Aren't those...

00:21:07.099 --> 00:21:09.625
So, you thought you would
distract the patrol, did you?

00:21:09.701 --> 00:21:13.194
Your simplistic feint won't
escape the critical eye of Luchs!

00:21:13.338 --> 00:21:17.434
Damn! They've got a brain trust
equal to Cherry on their side!

00:21:19.311 --> 00:21:20.540
Damn you, Otaru Mamiya!

00:21:20.612 --> 00:21:22.080
You won't escape!

00:21:31.423 --> 00:21:32.788
Well done, Luchs!

00:21:32.858 --> 00:21:35.555
Well, my tricky little
Japoness monkeys...

00:21:35.627 --> 00:21:37.721
...what do you plan to do now?

00:21:38.297 --> 00:21:42.734
My detachment is already on its way
to Japoness to begin the invasion!

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:54.078
You unbelievable bastard!

00:22:13.198 --> 00:22:16.930
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:17.002 --> 00:22:20.666
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:20.806 --> 00:22:23.707
Just think of me...

00:22:23.775 --> 00:22:28.337
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:28.613 --> 00:22:32.379
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:32.451 --> 00:22:36.081
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:36.254 --> 00:22:39.986
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:40.058 --> 00:22:41.787
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:45.819
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:47.933 --> 00:22:50.265
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:50.335 --> 00:22:55.296
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:55.507 --> 00:22:59.171
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:59.378 --> 00:23:02.939
...one step at a time.

00:23:03.181 --> 00:23:06.811
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:06.885 --> 00:23:10.651
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:10.822 --> 00:23:14.383
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:14.760 --> 00:23:20.722
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:30.142 --> 00:23:31.576
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:31.643 --> 00:23:35.841
We were rescued from our sticky
situation by that little boy, "Michael.”

00:23:35.914 --> 00:23:39.214
There are lots of nice people
in Gartlant too, you know!

00:23:39.284 --> 00:23:43.152
What?! If you do THAT to
a main computer, it will break?!

00:23:43.221 --> 00:23:45.189
And, if you do that,
it will be all fixed again...

00:23:45.257 --> 00:23:47.658
...and then, THAT will
break it again...?

00:23:47.726 --> 00:23:49.922
| don't understand it...

00:23:50.862 --> 00:23:54.765
Maiden Circuits Win The Day?!
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:54.833 --> 00:23:56.927
I love you, Otaru!!
